            "review_title": "Review at Hu Tieu Ca Che Khiem",
            "review_text": "Hiệp\n3 contributions\n0\nWonderful breakfast in Vietnam, so delicious, so Vietnamese\nJan 2020\nThe noodle shop is very crowded in the mornings, especially a lot of the elderly. The soup of the dish has a very distinctive taste and very delicious. An best friend of mine who lived in this area recommended this shop when we came to visit her.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 2, 2020",
